* HS200 high-speed op-amp, vendor-style PSpice macro model
* Pins: IN+ IN- OUT VCC VEE
* A0 = 100 V/mV, open-loop pole 1 kHz (GBW 100 MHz), output swing to 1 V from the rails.
.SUBCKT HS200 IN+ IN- OUT VCC VEE PARAMS: A0=100k FP=1k ROUT=75
RIN   IN+ IN- 2MEG
CIN   IN+ IN- 1p
GM    0   N1  IN+ IN- 1
RP    N1  0   {A0}
CP    N1  0   {1/(6.2832*FP*A0)}
EOUT  OI  0   VALUE={LIMIT(V(N1),V(VEE)+1,V(VCC)-1)}
RO    OI  OUT {ROUT}
IQ    VCC VEE 5m
.ENDS HS200

* A second part of the same vendor file. This one cannot be read by the simulator
* (an unterminated expression); a circuit that does not use it must not be touched by it.
.SUBCKT HS200_BROKEN A B
EBAD A B VALUE={LIMIT(V(A),
RBAD A B 1k
.ENDS HS200_BROKEN
